'' AN INTERFACE AND A CLASS THROUGH A MODULE INTERFACE (docs/tiko-interfaces). Both are written
'' into it as text -- 'interface' is contextual, so tkiemit.tiko goes by the node -- and the
'' importer re-reads them: it inherits the interface into one of its own, extends the class
'' and implements the imported interface on a type of its own.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 -i tests/modules/src/ifacemod/libs tests/modules/src/ifacemod/app/main.bas -o tests/modules/ifacemod.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/modules/ifacemod.exe
'' RUN: tests/modules/ifacemod.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: me             animal         16
